{"sections":[{"slug":"稳定丛","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"稳定丛"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">稳定丛</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“稳定丛”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">或</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">的斜率</span> (slope) <span lang=\"zh\">是指度数除以阶数</span>:\n$$\r\n\\phi(F) = \\frac{\\deg (F)}{\\operatorname{rank}(F)}.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称向量丛为稳定从</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">半稳定丛</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">是指其所有非平凡子丛的斜率都小于</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">小于等于</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">本身的斜率</span>.</p>\n<p><span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/stable+vector+bundle\" title=\"nLab [https://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/stable+vector+bundle]\">nLab</a></span></p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/向量丛-投射模类比","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">向量丛</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">投射模类比</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}